---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SERVICE_CATEGORIES, OFFICIAL_CHANNELS } from '../data/valenciaData';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Government & Public Services — Citizen’s Charter Status & Transparency"
  description="Municipal government utility, service categories, RA 11032 Citizen’s Charter status disclosures, and DILG Full Disclosure Policy gateway for Valencia, Bohol."
>
  <section class="section-block section-deep">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Government &amp; Public Services · Municipality of Valencia, Bohol</span>
      <h1 class="display-hero" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.4rem);">
        Public Service Guide, Transparency &amp; Governance
      </h1>
      <p class="lead-paragraph">
        Designed so residents and partners can locate municipal service categories, transparency portals, and official channels in two clicks—while clearly indicating which schedules await the current signed RA 11032 Citizen’s Charter edition.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RA 11032 Citizen's Charter & 2015 Archival Caution -->
  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="callout-box" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <strong>RA 11032 Citizen’s Charter &amp; Fee Integrity Notice (`docs/00` item 2):</strong> An older <em>2015 Valencia Citizen’s Charter</em> exists on a third-party document host (Yumpu), but it is over a decade old and <strong>must not be used</strong> for current fees, processing times, or office window assignments. Under Republic Act No. 11032 (Ease of Doing Business and Efficient Government Service Delivery Act), only the municipality’s current signed Citizen’s Charter edition is authoritative. Until furnished by the LGU, each category below provides general orientation and directs residents to verified municipal channels.
      </div>

      <span class="eyebrow">Municipal Service Categories</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Core Public Services &amp; Responsible Offices</h2>

      <div class="grid-2">
        {SERVICE_CATEGORIES.map((svc) => (
          <article class="editorial-card" id={svc.id} style="padding: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.85rem);">
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.45rem; align-items: center;">
              <span class="badge badge-potential">{svc.charterStatus}</span>
              <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--ink-muted);">
                {svc.office}
              </span>
            </div>

            <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; margin: 0.45rem 0;">{svc.title}</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0; color: var(--ink-secondary);">{svc.summary}</p>

            <h4 style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
              Verified Resident Guidance
            </h4>
            <ul style="margin: 0 0 0.85rem 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--ink-secondary); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.35rem;">
              {svc.publicGuidance.map((g) => (
                <li>{g}</li>
              ))}
            </ul>

            <div style="margin-top: auto; padding-top: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--ink-muted);">
              <strong>Where to Confirm:</strong> {svc.officialChannelNote}
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Transparency, Full Disclosure Policy & Leadership Record -->
  <section class="section-block section-sand" id="transparency">
    <div class="container grid-2">
      <div class="editorial-card" style="padding: 1.65rem;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Public Financial &amp; Procurement Transparency</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 1.55rem;">DILG Full Disclosure Policy (FDP) &amp; Public Records</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--ink-secondary);">
          The Department of the Interior and Local Government (DILG) Full Disclosure Policy requires local government units to publish designated budget, expenditure, utilization, and procurement documents on the official national FDP Portal and in three conspicuous public places.
        </p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 1.2rem; color: var(--ink-secondary); font-size: 0.92rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.45rem;">
          <li>
            <strong>National FDP Portal:</strong> Search for <em>Region VII → Bohol → Valencia</em> on the official DILG Full Disclosure Policy Portal for uploaded financial statements.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>DILG Municipal Field Office Lead (`S009`):</strong> Public social mirror references exist for DILG Valencia, Bohol; direct official circulars should be verified via DILG Region VII or the Municipal Hall bulletin board.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Prototype Boundary:</strong> This independent prototype does not host unofficial PDF copies of municipal ordinances or financial statements without signed LGU release.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
          <a href="https://fdpp.dilg.gov.ph/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-dark">
            Open Official DILG FDP Portal ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="editorial-card" style="padding: 1.65rem;" id="leadership">
        <span class="eyebrow">Institutional Leadership &amp; BARUG Governance Record</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 1.55rem;">Municipal Leadership &amp; Verification Policy</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--ink-secondary);">
          In accordance with strict non-partisan editorial governance (`docs/01` &amp; `docs/06`), municipal leadership information is presented through dated public records rather than unverified live rosters:
        </p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 1.2rem; color: var(--ink-secondary); font-size: 0.92rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.45rem;">
          <li>
            <strong>June 29, 2025 Oath-Taking (`S005`):</strong> Local press (<em>Bohol Island News</em>) documented the oath-taking of newly elected Valencia municipal officials and the introduction of the <strong>BARUG Valencia</strong> governance guiding principle.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>October 2026 Governance Coverage (`S006`, `S026`):</strong> Press reports in <em>The Bohol Times</em> (Oct 4, 2026) and <em>Bohol Island News</em> (Oct 25, 2026) cover project discussions and Mayor Dionisio Neil A. Balite’s participation in the DAP AI governance course under the BARUG Valencia agenda.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Outdated Third-Party Entry Warning (`C5`):</strong> Wikipedia’s infobox (`S025`) still carries a May 2024 citation regarding a temporary suspension and acting mayor. Official current incumbency and Sangguniang Bayan committee assignments must always be confirmed directly with the Office of the Secretary to the Sangguniang Bayan or the Municipal PIO on the date of publication.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Official LGU &amp; PIO Channels →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Official Reference Links Table -->
  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Verified External Gateways</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 1.65rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Authoritative Public Channels &amp; Registries</h2>
      <div class="table-scroll">
        <table class="data-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Channel / Registry</th>
              <th>Role</th>
              <th>Verification Status (Checked 2026-11-06)</th>
              <th>Link</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {OFFICIAL_CHANNELS.map((ch) => (
              <tr>
                <td><strong>{ch.name}</strong></td>
                <td>{ch.scope}</td>
                <td>{ch.verificationStatus}</td>
                <td>
                  <a href={ch.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-weight: 700;">
                    Open ↗
                  </a>
                </td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
